# RNA-seq Training: Differential Gene Expression in *E. coli*

**Wild type (ECWT) vs *slyA* mutant (ECMS)**

A hands-on bioinformatics workshop that takes you through a complete RNA-seq analysis: from downloading raw sequencing reads to finding the genes that change between two bacterial strains. *Escherichia coli* has a small genome (about 4.6 Mb), so every step runs on an ordinary laptop.

