## The data

The data are from NCBI GEO [GSE168963](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE168963) (ENA project [PRJNA714667](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ena/browser/view/PRJNA714667)). There are 16 RNA-seq samples of *E. coli* BW25113 (runs `SRR13970433`–`SRR13970448`), each sequenced paired-end (2 FASTQ files per sample, 32 files):

| Group | Strain | Samples |
|---|---|---|
| **ECWT** | Wild type | 8 |
| **ECMS** | *slyA* mutant | 8 |

