```

`raw_data/` is excluded from GitHub (see [`.gitignore`](.gitignore)) because the reads and alignments are several GB. Only an empty placeholder (`raw_data/.gitkeep`) is kept, so the folder exists after cloning. The scripts recreate everything in it.

**Run every command from the `training/` folder.** Each script works out where `training/` is from its own location, so the folder can be anywhere on your computer.

