- NCBI GEO: [GSE168963](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE168963)
- ENA / SRA BioProject: [PRJNA714667](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ena/browser/view/PRJNA714667)
